      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Standing by the agency entrance, Andrea and Gabriel pause in front of the glass doors bearing the famous Samuel Kerr lettering. Remembering their late mentor and the ten intense years of cinema history created within these walls, they prepare to close the door for the very last time. Let's listen to their conversation in French first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
